{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36219","headline":"山中言事 · 方干","name":"山中言事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日与村家事渐同，烧松啜茗学邻翁。\n池塘月撼芙蕖浪，窗户凉生薜荔风。\n书幌昼昏岚气里，巢枝俯折雪声中。\n山阴钓叟无知己，窥镜撏多鬓欲空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}